{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"movie/157336","tmdb_id":157336,"title":"星际穿越","original_title":"Interstellar","overview":"近未来的地球黄沙遍野，小麦、秋葵等基础农作物相继因枯萎病灭绝，人类不再像从前那样仰望星空，放纵想象力和灵感的迸发，而是每日在沙尘暴的肆虐下倒数着所剩不多的光景。在家务农的前NASA宇航员库珀接连在女儿墨菲的书房发现奇怪的重力场现象，随即得知在某个未知区域内前NASA成员仍秘密进行一个拯救人类的计划。多年以前土星附近出现神秘虫洞，NASA借机将数名宇航员派遣到遥远的星系寻找适合居住的星球。在布兰德教授的劝说下，库珀忍痛告别了女儿，和其他三名专家教授女儿艾米莉亚·布兰德、罗米利、多伊尔搭乘宇宙飞船前往目前已知的最有希望的三颗星球考察。他们穿越遥远的星系银河，感受了一小时七年光阴的沧海桑田，窥见了未知星球和黑洞的壮伟与神秘。在浩瀚宇宙的绝望而孤独角落，总有一份超越了时空的笃定情怀将他们紧紧相连……","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c35Vwd9rmMQfaEJuUrJRF3LZWJX.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ssWTSVklAEc98frZUQhgtGHx7s.jpg","release_date":"2014-11-05","year":"2014","runtime":"169 minutes","tmdb_rating_average":8.475,"tmdb_votes":39816,"tmdb_rating":"8.475 / 10 from 39816 users","genres":["冒险","剧情","科幻"],"languages":["English"],"countries":["United Kingdom","United States of America"],"production_companies":["Legendary Pictures","Syncopy","Lynda Obst Productions"],"directors":[{"name":"克里斯托弗·诺兰","id":525}],"producers":[{"name":"琳达·奥布斯特","id":2162},{"name":"克里斯托弗·诺兰","id":525},{"name":"艾玛·托马斯","id":556}],"cast":[{"id":10297,"name":"马修·麦康纳","original_name":"Matthew McConaughey","character":"Cooper","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/lCySuYjhXix3FzQdS4oceDDrXKI.jpg"},{"id":1813,"name":"安妮·海瑟薇","original_name":"Anne Hathaway","character":"Brand","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/s6tflSD20MGz04ZR2R1lZvhmC4Y.jpg"},{"id":3895,"name":"迈克尔·凯恩","original_name":"Michael Caine","character":"Professor Brand","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/bVZRMlpjTAO2pJK6v90buFgVbSW.jpg"},{"id":83002,"name":"杰西卡·查斯坦","original_name":"Jessica Chastain","character":"Murph","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/lodMzLKSdrPcBry6TdoDsMN3Vge.jpg"},{"id":1893,"name":"卡西·阿弗莱克","original_name":"Casey Affleck","character":"Tom","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/304il